<title>UK: Hypobank sets warrants on the REX index.</title>
<headline>Hypobank sets warrants on the REX index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>HYPO-BANK AG says it has issued 10 million American-style bull and bear warrants, in two equal tranches, on the REX index.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	 STRIKE		   ISS PRICE</p>
<p> BULL	     111 INDEX POINTS     1.20 DEM</p>
<p> BEAR	     109 INDEX POINTS     2.30 DEM</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 30.JAN.97-01.DEC.98   PAYDATE	23.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   =			   MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
